{"id":"vod_bf_26762","vodId":"26762","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"齐木楠雄的灾难第一季","name_cn":"齐木楠雄的灾难第一季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-27/1ab78b195fdf7b4760fd878119f78313.jpg"},"summary":"齐木楠雄（神谷浩史 配音）是一名十六岁的高中二年级学生，从一出生开始，他便是一名全能超能力者，几乎掌握了一切叫得上名字的超能力，这表面上让人无比羡慕的特质却让齐木楠雄的生活陷入了无聊的绝望之中，因为他几乎不用付出任何的努力，便可以为所欲为。于是，齐木楠雄封印了自己的超能力，致力于做一个默默无闻的普通人。　　然而，齐木楠雄的身上似乎散发着吸引怪咖的电波，笨蛋不良少年燃堂力（小野大辅 配音）、中二病末期患者海腾顺（岛崎信长 配音）、色胆包天的灵能力者鸟束零太（花江夏树 配音）、从头到脚从内到外都闪耀着完美光辉的照桥心美（芽野爱衣 配音），这些千奇百怪个性迥异的怪人们总是一次又一次的将力求平凡的齐木楠雄拖入麻烦之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022ng8kM5cxindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022BgkzWVJJindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimunanxiongdezainandiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimun